      "en": "When Hushai the Archite, David’s friend, had come to Absalom, Hushai said to Absalom, “Long live the king! Long live the king!”",
      "ko": "다윗의 친구 아렉 사람 후새가 압살롬에게 나아올 때에 저에게 말하기를 왕이여 만세, 왕이여 만세 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "df50833693fa4afa81a9c352669c7d616817b68cc820f81171ab4c798816e561",
      "translation_text_hash": "020a66134bff6ac4f8bc5ac1008b4ae2455b75c511f7d114a051da846ec5ca61",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
