      ],
      "en": "Then Absalom said to Ahithophel, “Give your counsel what we shall do.”",
      "ko": "압살롬이 아히도벨에게 이르되 너는 어떻게 행할 모략을 우리에게 가르치라",
      "source_text_hash": "604259891a7dfef6f29e8a55491f17fe2f920497318c599a8b82b46264c1dbcf",
      "translation_text_hash": "f7f81319b63f42be4865ac09438627a518228cf4039e656c2ca30c8eaa640780",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
